  "notes": "grain-mill for the minilogue xd, tempo clock, half its ticks at random: 2 looping grain voices from a 5.5 s buffer, each reading from its own fixed distance back. Time = the tempo division and the grain envelope from short and harsh to long and smooth; Depth = grain size and feedback (full travel freezes the buffer); Shift+Depth = dry/wet. The voice is grain-voice.loguesub next to this file."
